### 三、 Kubernetes 业务配置 (Manifest)

在 EKS 中部署业务 Pod 时，不再需要创建 `Ingress` 去新建 ALB，直接使用 `TargetGroupBinding`。

#### `app-deploy.yaml`
```yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: my-app
  namespace: default
spec:
  replicas: 3
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: my-app
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: my-app
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: app
        image: nginx:latest
        ports:
        - containerPort: 80
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: my-app-service
  namespace: default
spec:
  type: ClusterIP # 不需要 NodePort/LoadBalancer
  ports:
  - port: 80
    targetPort: 80
    protocol: TCP
  selector:
    app: my-app
---
# 关键资源：将 Service 绑定到 Terraform 创建的 Target Group
apiVersion: elbv2.k8s.aws/v1beta1
kind: TargetGroupBinding
metadata:
  name: my-app-tgb
  namespace: default
spec:
  serviceRef:
    name: my-app-service # 对应上面的 Service 名称
    port: 80             # 对应 Service 端口
  targetGroupARN: <填入 Terraform 输出的 aws_lb_target_group.eks_tg.arn>
  targetType: ip         # 必须为 ip
```

