### 二、 CloudFormation 模板 (构建 Target Group & IRSA)

你可以让 Admin 直接通过 CloudFormation 控制台运行以下模版，或在你拿到权限后自行部署：

`eks-alb-integration.yaml`
```yaml
AWSTemplateFormatVersion: '2010-09-09'
Description: 'Provision Target Group for EKS and IRSA Role for AWS Load Balancer Controller'

Parameters:
  VpcId:
    Type: AWS::EC2::VPC::Id
    Description: VPC ID where EKS and ALB reside
  ExistingListenerArn:
    Type: String
    Description: ARN of the existing ALB Listener (e.g. arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:...:listener/app/...)
  EksClusterOidcIssuer:
    Type: String
    Description: OIDC Issuer URL for EKS (without https://, e.g. oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/XXXXX)
  TargetGroupName:
    Type: String
    Default: tg-eks-internal-app
    Description: Name of the new IP-mode Target Group

Resources:
  # 1. 创建 IP 模式的 Target Group (供 EKS Pod 直连)
  EksTargetGroup:
    Type: AWS::ElasticLoadBalancingV2::TargetGroup
    Properties:
      Name: !Ref TargetGroupName
      Port: 80
      Protocol: HTTP
      VpcId: !Ref VpcId
      TargetType: ip  # 必须是 ip，不能是 instance
      HealthCheckPath: /healthz # 按业务实际健康检查路径修改
      HealthCheckIntervalSeconds: 15
      HealthCheckTimeoutSeconds: 5
      HealthyThresholdCount: 2
      UnhealthyThresholdCount: 2
      TargetGroupAttributes:
        - Key: deregistration_delay.timeout_seconds
          Value: '30'

  # 2. 将现有 ALB Listener 的流量规则转发到新 Target Group
  AlbListenerRule:
    Type: AWS::ElasticLoadBalancingV2::ListenerRule
    Properties:
      ListenerArn: !Ref ExistingListenerArn
      Priority: 10 # 规则优先级，需确保与现有规则不冲突
      Conditions:
        - Field: path-pattern
          Values:
            - '/*'
      Actions:
        - Type: forward
          TargetGroupArn: !Ref EksTargetGroup

  # 3. 为 Controller 创建 IRSA IAM Role
  AwsLbControllerRole:
    Type: AWS::IAM::Role
    Properties:
      RoleName: !Sub 'aws-load-balancer-controller-role-${AWS::StackName}'
      AssumeRolePolicyDocument:
        Version: '2012-10-17'
        Statement:
          - Effect: Allow
            Principal:
              Federated: !Sub 'arn:aws:iam::${AWS::AccountId}:oidc-provider/${EksClusterOidcIssuer}'
            Action: 'sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity'
            Condition:
              StringEquals:
                !Sub '${EksClusterOidcIssuer}:sub': 'system:serviceaccount:kube-system:aws-load-balancer-controller'
                !Sub '${EksClusterOidcIssuer}:aud': 'sts.amazonaws.com'
      ManagedPolicyArns:
        - !Sub 'arn:aws:iam::${AWS::AccountId}:policy/AWSLoadBalancerControllerIAMPolicy'

Outputs:
  TargetGroupArn:
    Description: Use this ARN in the K8s TargetGroupBinding manifest
    Value: !Ref EksTargetGroup
    Export:
      Name: EksTargetGroupArn
  ControllerRoleArn:
    Description: IRSA Role ARN for AWS Load Balancer Controller Helm chart
    Value: !GetAtt AwsLbControllerRole.Arn
```

